  "header": "It can read the wallet. It cannot spend it.",
  "friendlyHeader": "It can see the spending. It cannot spend the money.",
  "summary": "The Daily Intelligence is a short daily brief on AI that changes work, tools, and ordinary decisions. Today Google let a US Gemini app read Wallet spending, but not move the money. Meta's Muse can phone a US business if you pay, and the person who answers may hang up. Mozilla will delete about 54,000 Solo websites on 30 November. The rest is a nationwide flight adviser a person still has to accept, a coding pause that is going away, and two open voice models you can run yourself.",
